#: ../../reference/errors.rst:8 8bea3ece512940c18aa9e58b3c99f6ef
msgid ""
"``HttpError`` can occur on unsigned Info calls. For signed calls, "
"ambiguous timeout, HTTP, and protocol failures are converted to "
"``IndeterminateActionError`` so applications do not mistake them for "
"confirmed rejections. See :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`."
msgstr ""
"``HttpError`` 可能出现在未签名的 Info 调用中。对于已签名调用，含糊的超时、HTTP 和协议失败"
"会转换为 ``IndeterminateActionError``，以便应用程序不会将其误认为已确认的拒绝。"
"请参阅 :doc:`../howto/lifecycle-reconciliation`。"
